1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,791
Eight friends. One bill. Who had the T-bone?

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,294
Snap the bill. Gemini reads every line, and checks it against the total.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,274
Share one link. No app, no sign-up.

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,672
Everyone taps what they had, and every phone updates live.

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,726
Shared plates split themselves.

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:26,320
Each person pays their exact share. Mobile money, card, or USDC.

7
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,140
Money only moves when the host approves.

8
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,778
Same engine runs the shop counter. Stock updates itself.

9
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,751
TrackSplit. Everyone pays for what they ate.
